  _replicas:
  - Dialogues:
    - Welcome to the manual of the Mann Co. Home Protection Unit ver. 1.95!
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - This new version enables you to use FOUR DIGIT CODES for your security system.
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - Enabling and disabling spikes works exactly as it did with previous models.
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - If you are prone to forgetting the code, write it down somewhere.
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - (Sani has written something here...)
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - (It says "Find the numbers in the rooms and sort them by the
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogues:
    - letters of the rooms they were in from A to D.")
    Icon: {fileID: 0}
    AnimationName: 
    SFX: {fileID: 0}
